{"title":"Career Roadmap: Production Designer","role":"Production Designer","summary":"Career Domain: Media, Communication, Arts & Design · Qualification Pathway: BFA – Art Direction / Set & Costume Design · Target Career: Production Designer","facts":{"Current degree":"BFA (Bachelor of Fine Arts)","Course":"Art Direction / Set & Costume Design"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Production Designer creates the whole visual world of a film, series or ad - sets, locations, colours and props - and leads the art department to build it."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Production Designer does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design the look of the film with the director and cinematographer"},{"text":"Plan and draw sets and locations"},{"text":"Lead the art department and budget"},{"text":"Supervise construction, dressing and props"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film and OTT productions"},{"text":"Ad film companies"},{"text":"TV and events"},{"text":"Theme parks and experiential projects"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Art Assistant"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Assistant Art Director"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Art Director"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Production Designer"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Senior Production Designer"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Foundations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drawing, perspective and colour"},{"text":"Film and art history"},{"text":"Learn SketchUp"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Set design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Study period styles and architecture"},{"text":"Make set models"},{"text":"Design for student films"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: On set"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assist an art department"},{"text":"Learn budgets and construction"},{"text":"Learn AutoCAD"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design a complete film's world"},{"text":"Show drawings, models and photos"},{"text":"Join productions as art assistant"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Set design"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Drafting and models"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Period research"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Working with directors"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Long hours"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Model-making tools"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film art departments"},{"text":"Ad productions"},{"text":"Event companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Set-safety training"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PG Diploma in Art Direction & Production Design (FTII, SRFTI)"},{"text":"M.Des"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to know:"},{"type":"list",